---
// Values come from the output shown in the post: [0 0 0] 3 6, then [0 0 0 7] 4 6.
---
<figure class="gp03b">
  <div class="gp03b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Two rows of six slots. First: three zeros then three spare slots, len 3 cap 6. Second: three zeros and a 7, then two spare slots, len 4 cap 6.">
<text x="20" y="55" class="strong">make([]int, 3, 6)</text>
    <rect x="260" y="30" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="295.0" y="55.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">0</text>
    <rect x="330" y="30" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="365.0" y="55.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">0</text>
    <rect x="400" y="30" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="435.0" y="55.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">0</text>
    <rect x="470" y="30" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell free" />
    <rect x="540" y="30" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell free" />
    <rect x="610" y="30" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell free" />
    <line x1="260" x2="470" y1="84" y2="84" class="ln" />
    <text x="480" y="89" class="strong">len 3</text>
    <line x1="260" x2="680" y1="108" y2="108" class="ln thin" />
    <text x="690" y="113" class="mut">cap 6</text>
    <text x="20" y="185" class="strong">append(t, 7)</text>
    <rect x="260" y="160" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="295.0" y="185.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">0</text>
    <rect x="330" y="160" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="365.0" y="185.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">0</text>
    <rect x="400" y="160" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="435.0" y="185.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">0</text>
    <rect x="470" y="160" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell hot" />
    <text x="505.0" y="185.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num hot">7</text>
    <rect x="540" y="160" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell free" />
    <rect x="610" y="160" width="70" height="40" rx="4" class="cell free" />
    <line x1="260" x2="540" y1="214" y2="214" class="ln" />
    <text x="550" y="219" class="strong">len 4</text>
    <line x1="260" x2="680" y1="238" y2="238" class="ln thin" />
    <text x="690" y="243" class="mut">cap 6</text>
    <text x="260" y="148" class="mut"><tspan data-lang-en>three used, three spare</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ba ô đang dùng, ba ô còn trống</tspan></text>
    <text x="260" y="278" class="mut"><tspan data-lang-en>append used one spare slot; the last two are still spare</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>append dùng một ô trống; còn hai ô trống</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>len counts the slots in use. cap counts all the reserved slots. Appending fills the next spare slot and moves len by one while cap stays 6.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>len đếm các ô đang dùng. cap đếm tất cả ô đã được dành sẵn. append lấp ô trống kế tiếp, len tăng một còn cap vẫn là 6.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp03b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp03b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp03b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp03b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp03b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp03b .mut { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp03b .strong { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp03b .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp03b .cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp03b .cell.free { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; stroke: var(--border); }
  .gp03b .cell.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp03b text.hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp03b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp03b .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp03b .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp03b .ln.thin { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp03b .ln.dash { stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .gp03b .ln.hot { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp03b .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp03b .hd.hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp03b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
